    "notes": {
        "02088594-c102-42cd-85d3-273db6d935b7": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 1616,
            "width": 720,
            "height": 260,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumptions\n\n- The Manychat account needs **at least one Text custom user field** (Settings → Fields → New User Field, type Text). Set Custom Field writes `E2E value` to the first Text field.\n- The Manychat API has **no endpoint to delete a subscriber**. Every run leaves one subscriber **E2E Updated** with the email `appmixer.e2e+<timestamp>@example.com`; delete them in Manychat (Contacts) from time to time.\n- The tag created by the run is deleted after AfterAll."
        }
    }
